<div id="S3.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.p20.1" class="ltx_p">Thus, the roots of <math id="S3.p20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\B(Q_{U_{h+1,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h+1,d-1}}(t))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\B(Q_{U_{h+1,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h+1,d-1}}(t))</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.p20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\B(Q_{U_{h,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h,d-1}}(t))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\B(Q_{U_{h,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h,d-1}}(t))</annotation></semantics></math> are interlacing.
Similar to the proof of Lemma <a href="#S3.Thmthm3" title="Lemma 3.3. ‣ 3 Log-concavity for paving matroid" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>, to finish the proof, we need to show that the Wronskian of <math id="S3.p20.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\B(Q_{U_{h+1,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h+1,d-1}}(t))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\B(Q_{U_{h+1,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h+1,d-1}}(t))</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.p20.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\B(Q_{U_{h,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h,d-1}}(t))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\B(Q_{U_{h,d}}(t)-Q_{U_{h,d-1}}(t))</annotation></semantics></math> is negative at <math id="S3.p20.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Recall that</p>
